{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uKfW3jqZNk1793691153.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國巴黎銀行董事長樂明瀚在出席國際金融領袖投資峰會時指出，香港於人民幣融資的角色，變得越來越重要。</p><p></p><p>法國巴黎銀行董事長樂明瀚說：「香港變得越來越重要，對於人民幣融資而言，這是連接中國與歐洲的關鍵橋樑。在我們來看這一點至關重要，活動正在升溫，為企業活動升溫，也為銀行升溫。是的，我們看到更多本地化，更多本地技能，對樞紐的需求，香港是非常好的地方。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.482873+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:38:22.124989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:51.475876+00:00","content_hash":"6cb8ccdd256cefc6df769a0879dcfa73a6e9d71e0a1d8ea7632e69361286216f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:37.482873+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}